.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16cuv.jpg"}, {"id": 1976216, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16cuw.jpg"}, {"id": 1976218, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16cuy.jpg"}, {"id": 1976217, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16cux.jpg"}, {"id": 1976225, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16cv5.jpg"}, {"id": 1976220, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16cv0.jpg"}, {"id": 1976226, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16cv6.jpg"}, {"id": 1976221, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16cv1.jpg"}, {"id": 1976223, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16cv3.jpg"}, {"id": 1976224, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16cv4.jpg"}, {"id": 1976219, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16cuz.jpg"}, {"id": 1976222, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16cv2.jpg"}], "slug": "go-long--1", "summary": "Go Long! is a floppy physics sports party game for 1-8 players. It starts as a game of catch in a shared park and escalates into four made-up 3v3 ball sports: Longball, where teams score by landing the ball in the other half and must catch everything that comes into their own; Rushball, where players run, pass and throw the ball into a goal; Hoopball, the same idea with a hoop and no keeper; and Bonk, a take on dodgeball. Before kickoff each player picks a loadout of three powers from 16, such as Curveball, Banana Peels and Big Glove. At halftime a giant boss, such as a T-Rex, a Kraken, a dragon or Santa, crashes the match and both teams pelt its weak spots for bonus points.\n\nMatches take place across seven stadiums, each with its own hazard, from wind in the park to lava, low gravity on the moon and ice at the North Pole. Modes include online 3v3 matchmaking, Chaos variants, private matches from 1v1 to 4v4 with friends or bots, online or offline, a League, knockout tournaments for up to 16 teams and Boss Rush. Between matches players share a park with proximity voice chat, side games such as Hot Potato and Keep-Away, a casino that uses in-game money only and a Prize Machine for cosmetics. Twitch integration lets a streamer's chat vote on match events.", "themes": [{"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}, {"id": 40, "name": "Party"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/go-long--1", "videos": [{"id": 202031, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "tye2iNwT2C4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tye2iNwT2C4", "title": "Go Long! \u2013 Official Trailer | Goofy 3v3 Catching Sport on Steam", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/tye2iNwT2C4/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 204585, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "ug4WAgU8xF0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ug4WAgU8xF0", "title": "Go Long! in 60 Seconds", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ug4WAgU8xF0/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 204586, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "vwEAye_bxd4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vwEAye_bxd4", "title": "How to Play Longball in 2 Minutes | Go Long!", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/vwEAye_bxd4/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 204587, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "lW9MmLCyhiA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lW9MmLCyhiA", "title": "All 6 Stadiums in Go Long! (Lava Included)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/lW9MmLCyhiA/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}